OL,3,GNEWSA'Easier to get Glastonbury tickets
OL,4,Athan farm fund'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA farmer missed out on #75,000 of
OL,7,Fgovernment funding from a green scheme
OL,8,Fbecause he was travelling to receive an
OL,9,Faward for eco-friendly practices.
OL,11,FOnline applications for the #233m
OL,12,FSustainable Farming Incentive (SFI)
OL,13,Ffunding for England closed in under six
OL,14,Fhours.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
