OL,3,GNEWSA'Easier to get Glastonbury tickets
OL,4,Athan farm fund'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTim Smith, 40, a third generation
OL,7,Ffarmer from East Coker, near Yeovil,
OL,8,Fsaid he started his application on his
OL,9,Fphone while travelling to Sussex but by
OL,10,Fthe time he got to his hotel the scheme
OL,11,Fhad shut. He said he was now
OL,12,Fconsidering putting 24 hectares of land
OL,13,Fset aside for wildflowers back to
OL,14,Farable production.
OL,16,FThe government said farmers had
OL,17,Fresponded "in force" to the scheme and
OL,18,Fthere would be further funding
OL,19,Fopportunities for 2027.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
